# {{lb|en|cricket|countable}} One of a pair of soft [[padded]] [[covering]]s that protect the legs of the person batting; a [[pad]] or [[batting pad]].
# {{lb|en|cricket|informal|uncountable}} A [[fielding]] [[position]] very [[close]] to the [[batsman]], [[square]] on the [[leg]] side, designed to [[catch]] the ball from a [[misplace]]d [[defensive]] [[shot]].
# {{lb|en|cricket|informal|countable}} A [[fielder]] in this position.